7891135", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618251_1533807591224468_7225354536590570107_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mgl0A-6rSVgQ7kNvwEsRkz2&_nc_oc=Adq04xzQ8YGur5l-29yvqNdjwgotWnKm5bcFGaLcS1-o6XexmSHgv7KuP94lIbSfQ8U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTQ72mQfB8LcqFFQ-JW2IZ-Y4Vlhfi6cbWQkNwY7Skitg&oe=6B0DC8DB"}, {"file_name": "deadeye_saloon_007.png", "id": "1394096562246069", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618103_1394096565579402_5327944850542890591_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oJbD_Yb_0PYQ7kNvwFtSfgV&_nc_oc=AdrEnSxsqus0x-qAUC41o5bBBwmGnpJ2n9mgPeHh4o1iXFG2R1MKZpNuwWvD1UEXhRE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQT6iT0SPl86XsxWf4ziSshBLbUhD9qZxhEmevGTnKF2AA&oe=6B0DB799"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "StoreCover_2560x1440.png", "id": "1511443186749788", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618251_1511443190083121_6071622312822294156_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gTWp8BYtKGsQ7kNvwF9ESmU&_nc_oc=AdrNQ3R_hE0IEZIVvdGGxcZjGmfD5GRAZZ0lVShVaRNB8OFDAxPb7ilSz0_1a411B6U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQ0dUd5zbXpRM_RRjK3HfJrWhuHJsaVOSQVvxuMHxRb4Q&oe=6B0DD0C2"}, "display_name": "Deadeye Saloon", "keywords": ["party"], "long_description": "# Deadeye Saloon (Beta)\n\nWelcome to **Deadeye Saloon**, a simple and playful VR showdown you can enjoy **with no controllers, no movement, and no hassle.** Just sit back, raise your hands, and let your gestures decide the duel.\nIn this saloon, victory comes from **recognizing matching card pairs.** See a pair? **Quickly form the right hand gesture** to strike first and outplay your opponent. Fast reads and fast hands win the round.\nDesigned for pure comfort, you can play **seated**, in your most relaxed spot, using only your headset and your hands.\nDeadeye Saloon is currently in **Beta**, with more rules, items, and modes on the way. Jump in now for lighthearted duels\u2014and stay tuned as the saloon grows with future updates.", "short_description": "Deadeye Saloon is a fast multiplayer VR party game built entirely on hand gestures.\nAll players draw and reveal cards simultaneously. When a matching gesture card pair appears, performing the correct gesture activates powerful abilities"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1siPztmxhlIPsCskr2MIo3liJmgP1yFzLwWF-qobSDSg", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "4EX", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://deadeyesaloon.myportfolio.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1700921480735423"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "25571721795787008"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "3010042385834437"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "3010042385834437"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1765489380, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "3010042385834437"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "25572179575741230", "version": "1.0.2"}, "id": "708970155107578", "channel_nam